OL,3,GNEWSASchool Street fines at one
OL,4,Alocation exceed #1m
OL,5,
OL,6,FA London council has issued more than
OL,7,F#1m worth of penalty charge notices
OL,8,F(PCNs) to drivers under a School Street
OL,9,Fscheme in less than two years.
OL,11,FBrent Council issued PCNs totalling
OL,12,F#1.15m after introducing the scheme
OL,13,Foutside Manor School in Kensal Rise in
OL,14,FNovember 2024, saying it would improve
OL,15,Froad safety and the environment.
OL,17,FWard councillor Barbara Want raised
OL,18,Fconcerns about the scheme and claimed
OL,19,Fthat the signs were "too high and not
OL,20,Fproperly visible".
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
